<title>USA: Video Update closes 6.1 mln shr offering.</title>
<headline>Video Update closes 6.1 mln shr offering.</headline>
<dateline>ST. PAUL, Minn. 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Video Update Inc said Wednesday its public offering of 6.1 million shares of class A common stock closed.</p>
<p>The net proceeds from the offering will be used to provide working capital, make acquisitions, reduce outstanding debt, open additional stores and meet other general corporate purposes, the company said.</p>
<p>Video Update owns, operates and franchises video specialty stores under the name &quot;Video Update&quot; in the United States and Canada.</p>
<p>--Reuters Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
